# 整个序列是一个原子请求；有效期只约束提交，不会在前序执行期间耗尽。
std_msgs/Header header
string<=16 interface_version
string<=64 sequence_id
string<=128 command_id
uint8 source
builtin_interfaces/Duration valid_for
bool user_confirmed
string<=64 map_id
string<=64 map_revision
string<=64 map_sha256
TaskSequenceStep[<=16] steps
---
bool accepted
bool replayed
uint16 reason_code
string<=64 sequence_id
string<=64 current_execution_id
string<=32 state
string<=512 message
